  <object id="9943" x="7699.44" y="6760.2" width="1534.03" height="369.121">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffffff">1. Set world.json -&gt; spawning.search_free_position to false, to spawn character in exact places. 

Oh, and you can use tiled 1.9 text fields. </text>
  </object>
  <object id="9945" x="7692.47" y="7192.8" width="862.03" height="277.121">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">2. You can create colliders to make invisible walls, like water on this map.</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9952" x="7686.29" y="7525.41" width="1867.55" height="309.727">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">3. Put any image into map images/ folder, and use scripting to create custom objects. 
You can find all scripting examples with comments below. </text>
  </object>
  <object id="9956" x="8001.44" y="7916.32" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">4. Simple talking gardener from glorio. </text>
  </object>
  <object id="9958" x="7983.26" y="8689.05" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">5. Guess the number game. </text>
  </object>
  <object id="9960" x="8011.26" y="9705.05" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">5. Singing gardeners</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9971" x="7987.26" y="12433" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">6. This gardener can ensure you have an 100 diamonds.</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9972" x="9887.26" y="12429" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">7. This gardener trade 100 diamonds to 1 healwand.</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9974" x="9847.26" y="11485" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">8. Use this gardener to clear your inventory</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9976" x="9755.26" y="10641" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">9. Setup logs in settings/log4rs.yml to debug scripts</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9977" x="10207.3" y="9829.05" width="1199.91" height="272.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">10. Spawn example</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9979" x="13128" y="10280" width="1263.91" height="416.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">11. You can use `shape_from_tiled` property, to load physics shape (width/height/type) from tiled. 
Step up on this puddle, to receive deathshield. </text>
  </object>
  <object id="9982" x="12420" y="8660" width="1263.91" height="416.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">12. You can use rotation also</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9986" x="12404" y="11608" width="1595.91" height="408.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">13. Map objects attach sandboxed mod behaviours by canonical ID.
Enable demo:map and edit mods/map_behaviors/behaviors/interactive_prop.rhai; reload through the mod admin API. </text>
  </object>
  <object id="9989" x="10636" y="8540" width="1595.91" height="408.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">14. You can also work with components and damages.</text>
  </object>
  <object id="9966" x="7967.26" y="11297" width="1079.91" height="248.636">
   <text fontfamily="MS Shell Dlg 2" pixelsize="67" wrap="1" color="#ffaa00">6. Doors example</text>
  </object>
